            "line_thickness": "normal",
            "accordion_heading": "Description",
            "heading_style": "font-heading",
            "accordion_text": "<p>Calmerceuticals Deep Hydrating Collagen Facemasks are luxurious hydrogel masks designed to deeply hydrate, smooth fine lines, and brighten your complexion. Infused with Niacinamide, Hyaluronic Acid, and Hydrolyzed Collagen, these masks deliver intense nourishment, promoting firmer, more radiant, and youthful-looking skin. Perfect for all skin types, they’re your ultimate beauty indulgence.</p>",
