            "accordion_text": "<p><strong>Hydrolyzed Collagen</strong>: Low molecular weight collagen that boosts skin elasticity, reduces fine lines and wrinkles, and promotes a firmer, more resilient complexion.</p><p><strong>Niacinamide</strong>: A powerhouse form of Vitamin B3 that brightens skin, evens tone, reduces redness, and minimizes the appearance of pores for a smooth, radiant complexion.</p><p><strong>Hyaluronic Acid</strong>: A deeply hydrating molecule capable of holding up to 1,000 times its weight in water, delivering intense moisture and plumping the skin for a youthful, dewy glow.</p>",
